alue":"\\Rightarrow \\Delta U = 0"},{"type":"text","value":"∵剩余的气体的体积变大"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Rightarrow W <   0"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = W + Q"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Rightarrow Q > 0"},{"type":"text","value":"，即剩余气体吸热 （1分）\n设剩余气体在集热器中占据的体积为"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":"，整个集热器体积为 V，则："},{"type":"math","value":"P_{1}V_{x}=P_{0}V"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Rightarrow \\frac{V_{x}}{V}=\\frac{P_{0}}{P_{1}}=\\frac{5}{6}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n即剩余气体的质量与原来总质量的比值为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{5}{6}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-zhennan-mingxiao-lianmeng-2410-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-zhennan-mingxiao-lianmeng-2410","source_question_id":"gaosan-zhennan-mingxiao-lianmeng-2410-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"f2882053edeb8a05c577461415495c98d084d7cb3919910ebc88c12c75d4d128","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. （11分）如图所示，一弹射装置由轨道OABC、直轨道CD和DE、左右对称的“雨滴”形曲线轨道EFG（F为最高点）和L形滑板组成。已知OA竖直，ABC是圆心在 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、半径R=0.2m的圆弧（B为最高点）。L形滑板质量M=0.06kg，上表面（除突出部分）长为L=1m，上表面的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu=0.6"},{"type":"text","value":" ，下表面光滑，其余轨道也均光滑。除L形滑板外，其余轨道均固定在地面上。弹簧下端固定，处于原长时上端与A和 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 都等高。B点距地面高度 "},{"type":"math","value":"h_{B}=0.8m"},{"type":"text","value":" 。 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{1}C"},{"type":"text","value":" 与竖直方向夹角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" ，CD与水平方向夹角也为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" ，且 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{2}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。一质量m=0.03kg的小滑块穿套在轨道OABC上，不与弹簧相连，压缩弹簧后滑块被弹出，滑到C点飞出后，立刻沿CD下滑，CD与DE平滑相接。图中圆1和圆2分别为E、F两点的曲率圆，半径分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}=0.8m"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}=0.2m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，曲率圆的半径也称为曲线在该处的曲率半径。g取10m/s²。\n（1）若已知弹簧劲度系数 K=30N/m，则当小滑块放在弹簧上处于静止状态时，求弹簧的压缩量 x；\n（2）某次弹射后，发现滑块到达 C 点时恰好对轨道无作用力，求滑块运动到 A 处时的速度大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（3）某次弹射后，发现滑块在轨道 EFG 内运动时，其向心加速度大小恒为 "},{"type":"math","value":"a_{n}=2g"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求轨道 EFG 内任意高度 h 处的曲率半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho"},{"type":"text","value":" 与 h 的函数关系式。（提示：任意曲线运动的向心加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"a_{n}=\\frac{v^{2}}{\\rho}"},{"type":"text","value":" ）\n（4）已知 EFG 轨道的形状及大小就是（3）问中所求的结果，滑块与 L 形滑板发生的碰撞是弹性碰撞。现要使滑块能到达、且不会从 L 形滑板上脱落，求滑块运动在 A 点时速度大小的取值范围。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3de78f3169c7c601fb877a860eda71eddcf070a48a2f35c74be4634836cbc256.png","width":830,"height":249,"width_mm":97.534,"row_group":"gaosan-zhennan-mingxiao-lianmeng-2410-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. (11 分) 解:\n（1）根据胡克定律："},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{F = kx}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\text{ 而 } \\mathrm{F} = \\mathrm{mg}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Rightarrow x = \\frac {m g}{k}"},{"type":"text","value":"代入数据得："},{"type":"math","value":"x = 0.01\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n(2) 在 C 点:"},{"type":"math","value":"mg \\cos \\theta = m \\frac{v_{c}^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n代入数据得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{c}=\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{3}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"从 A 点到 C 点："},{"type":"math","value":"-mgR\\cos\\theta=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{c}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{A}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n代入数据得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{A}=2m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n（3）在E点："},{"type":"math","value":"a_{n} = 2g = \\frac{v_{E}^{2}}{R_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n代入数据得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{E}=4m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"从 E 点到 P 点："},{"type":"math","value":"-mgh=\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{E}^{2}"},{"type":"math","value":"v ^ {2} = 1 6 - 2 0 h"},{"type":"text","value":"在 P 点:"},{"type":"math","value":"a_{n}=2g=\\frac{v^{2}}{\\rho}"},{"type":"text","value":"有以上式子解得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho = 0.8 - h"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n在 F 点:"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}=0.2m"},{"type":"math","value":"h _ {\\mathrm{F}} = 0. 6 m;\\quad \\Rightarrow 0 \\leq h \\leq 0. 6 m"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（4）①若滑块恰好过 B 点，即"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{B}=0"},{"type":"math","value":"m g \\left(h _ {B} - h _ {F}\\right) = \\frac {1}{2} m v _ {F} ^ {2} - 0"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {\\mathrm{F}} = 2 m / s > \\sqrt {g R _ {2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"所以滑块若能过 B 点，则一定能过 F 点。（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Rightarrow -mgR = 0 - \\frac{1}{2}mv_{A\\min}^{2}"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{A\\min} = 2m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"②"},{"type":"math","value":"mv = (m + M)v_1"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv^2 = \\frac{1}{2}(m + M)v_1^2 + 2\\mu mgL"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"v = 6m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"从 A 点到 G 点："},{"type":"math","value":"mg(h_B - R) = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2 - \\frac{1}{2}mv_{A\\max}^{2}"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{A\\max} = 2\\sqrt{6}m/s"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Rightarrow 2m/s \\leq v_A \\leq 2\\sqrt{6}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-zhennan-mingxiao-lianmeng-2410-q19","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-zhennan-mingxiao-lianmeng-2410","source_question_id":"gaosan-zhennan-mingxiao-lianmeng-2410-q19","number":"19","order":19,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"161bf078d69abdc037a4583e1ce2b9d845425c4ea7b81f39ff60a50d112b76f8","body":[{"type":"text","value":"19. （11分）亥姆霍兹线圈是一种产生匀强磁场的器件，其结构主要由一对平行的完全相同的圆形线圈组成，两线圈通入方向相同的恒定电流后，在线圈间足够大的区域形成平行于中心轴线 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{1}O_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场。沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{1}O_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 建立 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴，一圆形接收屏接地并垂直于 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴放置，其圆心位于 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴上的 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 点，圆形接收屏可沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴方向左右移动，如图所示。在两线圈间的区域加上平行于 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴的匀强电场，粒子源从 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴上的 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 点以垂直于 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴的方向持续发射初速度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的粒子，已知粒子质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，电荷量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"q"},{"type":"text","value":" （ "},{"type":"math","value":"q > 0"},{"type":"text","value":" ），电场强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" ，磁感应强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" ，电场和磁场均沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向，不计粒子重力和粒子间相互作用。\n（1）①沿 x 轴正向从左向右观察，判断亥姆霍兹线圈通入电流的方向为顺时针还是逆时针？②未加电场时，粒子在线圈间做匀速圆周运动，求粒子做圆周运动的半径 r；\n（2）若粒子源在垂直于 x 轴的平面内，沿各向持续均匀发射速度大小均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的粒子，单位时间发射的粒子数为 n，粒子打到接收屏后被立即吸收，圆形接收屏的半径 R > 2r。\n①若要使所有粒子恰好打在接收屏的中心，求 OP 间的最小距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"d_{min}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n②若 OP 间的距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"d = \\frac{d_{\\min}}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求接收屏所受粒子作用力的大小。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a08d91e3913b182a3a860e1e082a4f36eaf609e99f0b839985fefd681a794a60.png","width":403,"height":282,"width_mm":47.295,"row_group":"gaosan-zhennan-mingxiao-lianmeng-2410-q19-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 19 题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"19. （11分）（1）①根据右手安培定则，可判断电流方向为顺时针（1分）；②粒子在磁场中，由洛伦兹力提供向心力可得："},{"type":"math","value":"qv_{0}B=\\frac{mv_{0}^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）解得轨道半径为："},{"type":"math","value":"r=\\frac{mv_{0}}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(2) ①粒子在磁场中运动的周期:"},{"type":"math","value":"T = \\frac{2\\pi m}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n粒子回到"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"轴的最短时间为:"},{"type":"math","value":"t = T"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n沿"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"轴方向:"},{"type":"math","value":"d_{\\min} = \\frac{1}{2} at^2"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分) 且"},{"type":"math","value":"qE = ma"},{"type":"text","value":"联立解得:"},{"type":"math","value":"d_{\\min} = \\frac{2\\pi^2mE}{qB^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n②根据对称，所有粒子在平行接收屏的方向施加的总作用力为零，\n故只考虑在垂直接收屏的方向的作用，\n根据动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"qE \\times \\frac{1}{4}d_{\\min} = \\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n根据动量定理："},{"type":"math","value":"Ft = \\Delta P"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n又P = mv 故"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta P = ntP = ntmv"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n联立解得："},{"type":"math","value":"F=\\frac{nm\\pi E}{B}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-zhennan-mingxiao-lianmeng-2410-q20","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-zhennan-mingxiao-lianmeng-2410","source_question_id":"gaosan-zhennan-mingxiao-lianmeng-2410-q20","number":"20","order":20,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"a359f4b7ae428f12a0f6d5879ae60d05d08e0ae2c84ff34b08477b0febe08c06","body":[{"type":"text","value":"20. （11分）如图甲所示，水平面内有两条间距为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L = 0.5 \\mathrm{~m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的不计电阻的平行金属直导轨，左端接一个原本不带电的电容器，电容 "},{"type":"math","value":"C = 0.2 \\mathrm{~F}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。导轨在 "},{"type":"math","value":"G"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"H"},{"type":"text","value":" 两处被不计长度的绝缘材料分隔开。一根长度也为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" 、质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 0.1 \\mathrm{~kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 1 \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 的金属棒 "},{"type":"math","value":"ab"},{"type":"text","value":" 跨放在 "},{"type":"math","value":"GH"},{"type":"text","value":" 左侧足够远处。另有质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"M = 0.2 \\mathrm{~kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、电阻为 "},{"type":"math","value":"6R = 6 \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 的均匀金属丝制成的一个半径也为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" 的刚性圆环，水平放在 "},{"type":"math","value":"GH"},{"type":"text","value":" 右侧某处，其圆心到两直导轨的距离相等。仅在两导轨之间的区域内有一个竖直向下的匀强磁场，磁感应强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"B = 1 \\mathrm{T}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。现给金属棒 "},{"type":"math","value":"ab"},{"type":"text","value":" 一个水平向右的初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" （大小未知），已知 "},{"type":"math","value":"ab"},{"type":"text","value":" 棒经过 "},{"type":"math","value":"GH"},{"type":"text","value":" 时速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1} = 5 \\mathrm{~m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。不计任何摩擦，且所有金属部件的接触处均连接良好，无接触电阻。\n（1）金属棒 ab 刚经过 GH 后的瞬间，a 点电势 （填空）b 点电势（选填“大于”或“小于”），并求 ab 两端的电压大小 U；\n（2）求电容器的最终带电量 Q 以及 ab 棒的初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（3）如图乙，撤去原磁场、金属棒 ab 和电容 C，在轨道右侧固定一个形状完全等同圆弧 EF 的绝缘挡板 IJ，并仅在曲线图形 EFJI 区域内加竖直向下的匀强磁场，磁感应强度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}=2.4T"},{"type":"text","value":" 。同时在两导轨的 P、N 处也由不计长度的绝缘材料分隔开； "},{"type":"math","value":"EP=FN=L,\\quad PI=NJ=\\frac{L}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，金属环触碰到挡板即被锁定不动。现给金属环一个水平向右的初速度 v=5m/s，方向与导轨平行。求金属环在整个运动过程中产生的焦耳热，以及通过金属环的 K 部位处横截面的电荷量。（K 位于圆弧 EF 之间）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/529735977fc2b8d8aaf5ff3da4fe50c11ea3336c0720a6e7d0a288e4fd3abaa4.png","width":551,"height":227,"width_mm":64.593,"row_group":"gaosan-zhennan-mingxiao-lianmeng-2410-q20-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d0201e176b4aa9b49cf0ba11d365fe48074324bacb939956bfe904e8ebefb216.png","width":485,"height":240,"width_mm":56.864,"row_group":"gaosan-zhennan-mingxiao-lianmeng-2410-q20-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第20题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"20. (11 分) 解:\n(1) a 点电势大于 b 点电势， (1 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{E} = \\mathrm{BLv} _ {1}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n根据题意，金属环在导轨间两段圆弧并联接入电路中，轨道外侧的两端圆弧金属环被短路可知，外电阻为 R/2，等效电源的内阻为 R\n所以 ab 刚越过 GH 时，ab 两端的电压大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"U=\\frac{1}{3}BLv_{1}=\\frac{5}{6}V"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n（2）稳定时，电容器两极板的电压"},{"type":"math","value":"U=BLv_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{C} = \\mathrm{Q} / \\mathrm{U}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Rightarrow Q=CBLv_{1}=0.5C"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n对金属棒 ab，由动量定理有"},{"type":"math","value":"-BiLt = mv_{1} - mv_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n即"},{"type":"math","value":"BLQ = mv_{0} - mv_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"代入数据得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=7.5m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（3）对金属环，到达 PN 之前，"},{"type":"math","value":"q _ {1} = \\frac {B _ {2} L ^ {2}}{2 R}"},{"type":"text","value":"由动量定理得"},{"type":"math","value":"- \\frac {B _ {2} ^ {2} L ^ {3}}{2 R} = M v _ {P} - M v"},{"type":"text","value":"过了PN之后，"},{"type":"math","value":"q _ {2} = \\frac {B _ {2} L \\frac {L}{2}}{6 R} = \\frac {B _ {2} L ^ {2}}{1 2 R}"},{"type":"text","value":"由动量定理得，"},{"type":"math","value":"- \\frac {B _ {2} ^ {2} L ^ {3}}{1 2 R} = M v _ {\\text{末}} - M v _ {P}"},{"type":"text","value":"电荷量"},{"type":"math","value":"q = q _ {1} + q _ {2} = \\frac {7 B _ {2} L ^ {2}}{1 2 R}"},{"type":"text","value":"代入数据得："},{"type":"math","value":"q = 0.35\\mathrm{C}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n金属环碰撞前的末速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {\\text{末}} = v - \\frac {7 B _ {2} ^ {2} L ^ {3}}{1 2 M R}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n由能量守恒得"},{"type":"math","value":"Q=\\frac{1}{2}Mv^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}Mv_{\\text{末}}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n代入数据得："},{"type":"math","value":"Q = 1.659J"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"}]}}]}
